+
+Returns B = active joystick lines as 1 bits, from complemented input at port
+`FEh` with BC = `F7FEh`. Status is always 0. Stack bound: 4 bytes. Historical
+cost: 214 T-states at `60e0768` (`src/services.asm:324-337`).
